      "Last reviewed",
      "25 September 2026",
      "Panel problems can look scary: vertical lines, half display, color patches, white screen, black screen or flickering. But every panel-looking issue is not always a dead panel. A proper inspection separates physical panel damage from backlight, T-Con, power and motherboard symptoms.",
      "What is LED TV panel repair?",
      "Panel repair means evaluating the display assembly and the parts that drive it. In some cases, a line or patch may be linked to panel bonding or internal panel damage. In other cases, the visible issue is caused by a board, T-Con or connection problem. GR Solution explains this difference before customers spend on repair.",
      "Panel lines, patches and display symptoms",
      "Common symptoms include vertical lines, horizontal lines, half screen, color patches, white display, flickering, dim picture and sound without picture. The history of the fault matters: sudden impact, water exposure, recent shifting or wall-mount pressure can change the diagnosis.",
      "Repair versus replacement",
      "Repair may be practical when the problem is related to backlight, board, T-Con or certain connection symptoms. Replacement may be better when the screen is physically cracked, water damaged, heavily lined or uneconomical to restore.",
      "Delhi service planning",
      "For Delhi homes and offices, share the exact location, floor, nearby landmark and wall-mount status. Areas such as New Kondli, Mayur Vihar, Laxmi Nagar, Preet Vihar, South Delhi, West Delhi, Dwarka and Rohini may need different visit planning depending on access and TV size.",
      "What to avoid before inspection",
      "Do not press the screen, open the back cover, repeatedly power-cycle the TV or move a large TV alone. These actions can make a repairable issue worse. Keep a photo or video of the symptom ready for GR Solution.",
      "Helpful Links",
      "LED TV Repair in Delhi",
      "TV Repair in Delhi",
      "Samsung TV Repair Delhi",
      "Contact GR Solution",
      "Final cost depends on screen size, model, fault type, parts availability and whether repair is possible. GR Solution provides inspection-based guidance before work begins.",
      "FAQ",
      "LED TV Panel Repair Delhi FAQs",
      "Can LED TV panel lines be repaired?",
      "Sometimes, depending on whether the cause is panel-level damage, T-Con, board behavior or connection symptoms.",
      "Is panel bonding always possible?",
      "No. Panel bonding depends on the panel type, damage level and available repair feasibility.",
      "Is a black screen always a panel issue?",
      "No. A black screen can be backlight, power, T-Con, mainboard or panel related.",
      "Should I repair or replace the TV?",
      "Compare fault type, TV age, screen condition, part availability and estimate before deciding.",
